[{"title":"","label":"第 188 则","author":"","text":"若无诗酒，则山水为具文；若无佳丽，则花月皆虚设。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 188 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[187]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 189 则","author":"","text":"才子而美姿容，佳人而工著作，断不能永年者。匪独为造物之所忌，盖此种原不独为一时之宝，乃古今万世之宝，故不欲久留人世，以取亵耳！","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 189 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[188]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 190 则","author":"","text":" 陈平封曲逆侯，《史》、《汉》注皆云“音去遇”。予谓此是北人土音耳。若南人四音俱全，似仍当读作本音为是。（北人于唱曲之曲，亦读如去字。）","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 190 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[189]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 191 则","author":"","text":"古人四声俱备，如“六”、“国”二字皆入声也。今梨园演苏秦剧，必读“六”为“溜”，读“国”为“鬼”，从无读入声者。然考之《诗经》，如“良马六之”、“无衣六兮”之类，皆不与去声叶，而叶祝告燠；“国”字皆不与上声叶，而叶入陌质韵。则是古人似亦有入声，未必尽读“六”为“溜”，读“国”为“鬼”也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 191 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[190]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 192 则","author":"","text":"闲人之砚，固欲其佳；而忙人之砚，尤不可不佳。娱情之妾，固欲其美；而广嗣之妾，亦不可不美。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 192 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[191]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 193 则","author":"","text":" 如何是独乐乐，曰鼓琴；如何是与人乐乐，曰弈棋；如何是与众乐乐，曰马吊。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 193 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[192]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 194 则","author":"","text":"不待教而为善为恶者，胎生也；必待教而后为善为恶者，卵生也；偶因一事之感触而突然为善为恶者，湿生也（如周处、戴渊之改过，李怀光反叛之类）；前后判若两截，究非一日之故者，化生也（如唐玄宗、卫武公之类）。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 194 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[193]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 195 则","author":"","text":"凡物皆以形用，其以神用者，则镜也、符印也、日晷也、指南针也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 195 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[194]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 196 则","author":"","text":"才子遇才子，每有怜才之心；美人遇美人，必无惜美之意。我愿来世托为绝代佳人，一反其局而后快。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 196 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[195]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 197 则","author":"","text":"予尝欲建一无遮大会，一祭历代才子，一祭历代佳人。俟遇有真正高僧，即当为之。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 197 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[196]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 198 则","author":"","text":"圣贤者，天地之替身。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 198 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[197]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 199 则","author":"","text":"天极不难做，只须生仁人君子有才德者二三十人足矣。君一、相一、冢宰一，及诸路总制、抚军是也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 199 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[198]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 200 则","author":"","text":"掷“升官图”，所重在德，所忌在赃。何一登仕版，辄与之相反耶？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 200 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[199]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 201 则","author":"","text":"动物中有三教焉：蛟、龙、麟、凤之属，近于儒者也；猿、狐、鹤、鹿之属，近于仙者也；狮子、牯牛之属，近于释者也。##植物中有三教焉：竹、梧、兰、蕙之属，近于儒者也；蟠桃、老桂之属，近于仙者也；莲花、薝蔔之属，近于释者也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 201 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[200]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 202 则","author":"","text":"佛氏云：“日月在须弥山腰。”果尔，则日月必是绕山横行而后可。苟有升有降，必为山巅所碍矣。又云：“地上有阿耨达池，其水四出，流入诸印度。”又云：“地轮之下为水轮，水轮之下为风轮，风轮之下为空轮。”余谓此皆喻言人身也。须弥山喻人首，日月喻两目；池水四出喻血脉流通，地轮喻此身，水为便溺，风为泄气。此下则无物也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 202 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[201]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 203 则","author":"","text":"苏东坡和陶诗，尚遗数十首。予尝欲集坡句以补之，苦于韵之弗备而止。如《责子诗》中“不识六与七”、“但觅梨与栗”，“七”字与“栗”字，皆无其韵也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 203 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[202]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 204 则","author":"","text":"予尝偶得句，亦殊可喜。惜无佳对，遂未成诗。其一为“枯叶带虫飞”，其一为“乡月大于城”。姑存之，以俟异日。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 204 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[203]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 205 则","author":"","text":" “空山无人，水流花开”二句，极琴心之妙境；“胜固欣然，败亦可喜”二句，极手谈之妙境；“帆随湘转，望衡九面”二句，极泛舟之妙境；“胡然而天，胡然而帝”二句，极美人之妙境。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 205 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[204]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 206 则","author":"","text":"镜与水之影，所受者也；日与灯之影，所施者也；月之有影，则在天者为受，而在地者为施也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 206 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[205]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 207 则","author":"","text":"水之为声有四：有瀑布声，有流泉声，有滩声，有沟浍声；风之为声有三：有松涛声，有秋叶声，有波浪声；雨之为声有二：有梧叶、荷叶上声，有承檐溜竹筒中声。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 207 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[206]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 208 则","author":"","text":"文人每好鄙薄富人，然于诗文之佳者，又往往以金玉、珠玑、锦绣誉之，则又何也？","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 208 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[207]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 209 则","author":"","text":"能闲世人之所忙者，方能忙世人之所闲。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 209 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[208]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 210 则","author":"","text":"先读经，后读史，则论事不谬于圣贤；既读史，复读经，则观书不徒为章句。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 210 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[209]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 211 则","author":"","text":"居城市中，当以画幅当山水，以盆景当苑囿，以书籍当朋友。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 211 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[210]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 212 则","author":"","text":"乡居须得良朋始佳，若田夫樵子仅能辨五谷而测晴雨，久且数，未免生厌矣。而友之中又当以能诗为第一，能谈次之，能画次之，能歌又次之，解觞政者又次之。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 212 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[211]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 213 则","author":"","text":"玉兰，花中之伯夷也(高而且洁)；葵，花中之伊尹也(倾心向日)；莲，花中之柳下惠也(污泥不染)。鹤，鸟中之伯夷也(仙品)；鸡，鸟中之伊尹也(司晨)；莺，鸟中之柳下惠也(求友)。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 213 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[212]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 214 则","author":"","text":"无其罪而虚受恶名者，蠹鱼也（蛀书之虫另是一种，其形如蚕蛹而差小）；有其罪而恒逃清议者，蜘蛛也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 214 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[213]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 215 则","author":"","text":"臭腐化为神奇，酱也，乳也，金汁也；至神奇化为臭腐，则是物皆然。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 215 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[214]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 216 则","author":"","text":"黑与白交，黑能污白，白不能掩黑；香与臭混，臭能胜香，香不能敌臭。此君子小人相攻之大势也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 216 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[215]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 217 则","author":"","text":"耻之一字，所以治君子；痛之一字，所以治小人。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 217 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[216]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 218 则","author":"","text":"镜不能自照，衡不能自权，剑不能自击。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 218 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[217]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}},{"title":"","label":"第 219 则","author":"","text":"古人云：“诗必穷而后工。”盖穷则语多感慨，易于见长耳。若富贵中人，既不可忧贫叹贱，所谈者不过风云月露而已，诗安得佳！##苟思所变，计惟有出游一法。即以所见之山川风土、物产人情，或当疮痍兵燹之余，或值旱涝灾棂之后，无一不可寓之诗中。借他人之穷愁，以供我之咏叹，则诗亦不必待穷而后工也。","collection":"幽梦影 · 第 219 则","sourceWork":"","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","commit":"b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee","path":"幽梦影/youmengying.json","pointer":"$[218]","sha256":"02fe9f8d80ec2506e7b4b797953b15ed0145dc7ebacecab2798647ebff4419e4","separatedNotes":[]}}]